{"id":"af898f828e135b93","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-sigman.md","title":"算术层次的编码递归","display":"df-sigman — 算术层次的编码递归","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-sigman","aliases":["43-df-sigman"],"display":"df-sigman — 算术层次的编码递归","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.5, print p.17 / PDF p.37","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-sigman"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-sigman</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigman — 算术层次的编码递归"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.5, print p.17 / PDF p.37"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>所有有限元自然数关系通过固定有效配对编码为自然数子集；因此下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\)</span> 而非把自然数集R直接当成二元谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_0:=\\Pi^0_0:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{Computable}(\\chi_A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^0_0:=\\Pi^0_0:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{Computable}(\\chi_A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_{n+1}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists R\\in\\Pi^0_n\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^0_{n+1}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists R\\in\\Pi^0_n\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_{n+1}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma^0_{n+1}\\},\\qquad\\Delta^0_n:=\\Sigma^0_n\\cap\\Pi^0_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^0_{n+1}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma^0_{n+1}\\},\\qquad\\Delta^0_n:=\\Sigma^0_n\\cap\\Pi^0_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>修复旧文R∈Π⁰_n后又直接调用R(x,y)的元数漂移；补入Π、Δ及第0层。本递归与书中交替数量词块定义等价。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.5, print p.17 / PDF p.37。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_0:=\\Pi^0_0:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{Computable}(\\chi_A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_{n+1}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists R\\in\\Pi^0_n\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_{n+1}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma^0_{n+1}\\},\\qquad\\Delta^0_n:=\\Sigma^0_n\\cap\\Pi^0_n.","display":true}],"bytes":1340,"backlinks":[{"id":"801b1a72671fc17a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；Σ⁰₂、Π⁰₂采用 [[43-df-sigman]]。"},{"id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$V\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$\\sqsubseteq$、$\\Sigma^0_n$、$\\#_2$ 分别采用 [[43-df-prefix]]、[[43-df-sigman]]、[[43-df-effective-coding]]。$\\mathcal S_n$ 为下式定义的有限串集族。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-sigman]] — 算术层次的编码递归"},{"id":"e4f81d62107f6eeb","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；Σ、Π、Δ见 [[43-df-sigman]]，CE^B见 [[43-df-ce]]。$\\le_m$见 [[43-df-many-one]]。"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104","f357216a7edb035a","aa33e0ea8422ba2a"]}